{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1477877-20a-lore-of-the-kiths","id":1477877,"title":"20A Lore of the Kiths?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-04-01T17:20:51-07:00","id":1477877,"title":"20A Lore of the Kiths?","content":"Hello. Are there plans to do a Changeling: The Dreaming 20th Anniversary edition Lore of the Kiths, akin to the Mage: Lore of the Traditions that was recently Kickstarted or the already published Vampire: Lore of the Clans and Lore of the Bloodlines?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26114-muskrat","name":"Muskrat","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"75"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-04-01T22:37:00-07:00","id":1477884,"title":"","content":"There aren't any plans for a Lore of Kiths book for C20 I believe but that does sound like a pretty cool idea!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27083-truemrmultiverse","name":"TrueMrMultiverse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27083_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"85"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-04-02T07:50:15-07:00","id":1477898,"title":"","content":"Agreed, a <b>Lore of the Kiths</b> book would be grand. I'd love to see Kith specific Merits and Flaws and a section on retooling the Kiths to closer reflect different traditions.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-04-02T07:52:51-07:00","id":1477899,"title":"","content":"While it's unlikely to be officially published (putting it mildly), there's always STV.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-04-03T10:27:29-07:00","id":1477955,"title":"","content":"Is this because Changeling: The Dreaming isn't popular enough to warrant more supplements? If so, that's a pity, but understandable from the publisher's perspective.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26114-muskrat","name":"Muskrat","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"75"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-04-03T13:14:53-07:00","id":1477967,"title":"","content":"I'm not sure what the reason is. But apparently, the design team at Onyx Path has made numerous proposals to Paradox for future c20 books; and they have all been rejected. And it appears that several of their proposals have since been published through Storyteller's Vault. <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/m/product/388455\" target=\"_blank\">Harbingers of Winter</a>, for instance, details the encroachment of the Endless Winter goes into more detail about the Autumn People (including Stigmas) and Dream Eaters, the Dauntain (with new Dooms, a new Art, and Schisms in the Dreaming), the Thallain (with rules for Dark Glamour and Nightmare Freeholds, and a new Thallain Kith), hints about the return of the Fomorians (which ties into a STV supplement for <b>Dark Ages: Fae</b> called <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/m/product/317130\" target=\"_blank\">Past is Prologue</a>), the return of the Tithed, and how changeling society is reacting to these developments.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","e